{"overview":"ژاپن، اوایل قرن نوزدهم. » دکتر نايدي « (میفونه)، مشهور به»ریش قرمز «، پزشک مسئول یک درمانگاه عمومی فقیرانه است.»دکتر نوبورو ياسوموتو « (کایاما)، پزشک یار جدید، به رغم نافرمانی‌های اولیه‌اش از»ریش قرمز«، از جمله به خاطر افراط در نوش خواری و پوشش غیر معمولش، سرانجام می‌آموزد که یک پزشک خوب باید فداکاری کند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Aspiring to an easy job as personal physician to a wealthy family, Noboru Yasumoto is disappointed when his first post after medical school takes him to a small country clinic under the gruff doctor Red Beard. Yasumoto rebels in numerous ways, but Red Beard proves a wise and patient teacher. He gradually introduces his student to the unglamorous side of the profession, ultimately assigning him to care for a prostitute rescued from a local brothel.","tagline_en":"What is the key to life - power, prestige or peace?","runtime":185,"status":"Released","seasons":[],"episodes":null,"crew":["آکیرا کوروساوا"],"crew_en":["Akira Kurosawa"],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"توشیرو میفونه","role":"Dr. Kyojio Niide (\"Red Beard\")","photo":"/cZ5ybA7cDA0EBMaM5jX2f7RNBVb.jpg","en":"Toshirō Mifune"},{"name":"加山雄三","role":"Dr. Noboru Yasumoto","photo":"/AhHdJdjNC4kmKnvw7AirUK9WmDl.jpg","en":"Yūzō Kayama"},{"name":"山崎努","role":"Sahachi","photo":"/yXU5Du92CSkUAOcPbxTR5buu3w8.jpg","en":"Tsutomu Yamazaki"},{"name":"団令子","role":"Osugi","photo":"/l0Qypa5XD7C2K6YqBQZj7cJyKp.jpg","en":"Reiko Dan"},{"name":"桑野みゆき","role":"Onaka","photo":"/e8UAgMOTMqrpd0cFakUyKQs2WVN.jpg","en":"Miyuki Kuwano"},{"name":"香川京子","role":"Madwoman (\"The Mantis\")","photo":"/q47wPwySJvhj6HQoYb7ON1TjbcV.jpg","en":"Kyōko Kagawa"},{"name":"江原達怡","role":"Genzô Tsugawa","photo":"/wk6s2lf4V1FtOPCs35ixbKNTK2P.jpg","en":"Tatsuyoshi Ehara"},{"name":"二木てるみ","role":"Otoyo","photo":"/4Ze5GpEoCV7t3Hy9ts24qotrnH3.jpg","en":"Terumi Niki"},{"name":"根岸明美","role":"Okuni","photo":"/oWE8EeeDOOMWFrgW6EPsAYdEnVZ.jpg","en":"Akemi Negishi"},{"name":"頭師佳孝","role":"Chobo","photo":"/egs03S4dJEKSYd